---
mount: mount
---
Absolute | mount=/teams/alpha.plan
Drive | mount=C:/teams/alpha.plan
Drive relative | mount=c:alpha.plan
Trailing slash | mount=teams/
Empty segment | mount=teams//alpha.plan
No path | mount=#backend
Two parts | mount=a.plan#x#y
Bad ID | mount=a.plan#-x
Empty ID | mount=a.plan#
Empty string | mount=""
Control | mount="a\tb.plan"
